List, show, apply, and import skill instruction bundles.

Usage:
  strap skills list
  strap skills show concise
  strap skills apply concise < state.json > next.json
  strap skills roots
  strap skills import-opencode ~/.config/opencode/skills

Skills are directories containing `SKILL.md` with optional OpenCode-style frontmatter. They are discovered from `.strap-user/skills`, `.strap/skills`, config skills, and root skills.
